OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including Stravinsky from
OL,9,     Fthe BBC Proms, Medtner from
OL,10,     FVerbier and Chopin from Granada.
OL,11,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,12,     FFrom Chichester Cathedral during
OL,13,     Fthe Southern Cathedrals Festival,
OL,14,     Fwith music by Ashfield, Rubbra and
OL,15,     FHowells.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Montgeroult
OL,17,     F3/5. Donald Macleod recounts how
OL,18,     FHelene de Montgeroult's piano
OL,19,     Fplaying saved her life.
